{"skill":{"slug":"mmxagent-guardian","displayName":"mmxagent-guardian"},"version":{"version":"1.0.3","createdAt":1773925259280,"changelog":"mmxagent-guardian v1.0.3\n\n- Expanded the definition of \"important files\" for longer retention to cover more system and config directories.\n- Introduced automatic skipping for generated, vendored, and cache directories (e.g., __pycache__, node_modules, .git); skipped files are now reported to the user with a reason.\n- Added a binary file size warning (for files over 50 MB) requiring user confirmation before backup.\n- Updated user confirmation and notification flow to reflect skipped files and size warnings.\n- No behavior changes for core modification/delete/restore operations.","changelogSource":"user","license":"MIT-0","files":[{"path":"SKILL.md","size":17621,"sha256":"ba6a8f2d09399c957b15e858c27efc8d2016801d76244a79be2c05eb09476180","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"file_guardian.DEPENDENCIES.md","size":1709,"sha256":"b7bab57dbd35bc9943fb453c4054c89dff1e9beed521e5d043491139f78bdd80","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"scripts/minivcs/minivcs.py","size":50348,"sha256":"9d167f59e5a5c1efc10b330e8e0e98ae79504dc48c78d3ecf050aff77e294cee","contentType":"text/x-python-script"},{"path":"skill-card.md","size":2232,"sha256":"547db541bd840862777fc4d02da8a4d9eecb67fbacb965da73f5605030331dd2","contentType":"text/markdown"}],"security":{"status":"suspicious","hasWarnings":true,"checkedAt":1789197943638,"model":null,"hasScanResult":true,"sha256hash":"97c59f6e2723a98748fed1a6697fec6f0ccd470e0c62bba5c295e43e97189afb","virustotalUrl":"https://www.virustotal.com/gui/file/97c59f6e2723a98748fed1a6697fec6f0ccd470e0c62bba5c295e43e97189afb","scanners":{"vt":{"status":"clean","verdict":null,"normalizedStatus":"clean","analysis":null,"source":"engines","checkedAt":1780086279845},"skillspector":{"status":"suspicious","normalizedStatus":"suspicious","score":100,"severity":"CRITICAL","recommendation":"DO_NOT_INSTALL","issueCount":14,"checkedAt":1789197943638},"llm":{"status":"suspicious","verdict":"suspicious","normalizedStatus":"suspicious","confidence":"high","summary":"The skill is a disclosed local file-protection tool, but it can copy, move, restore, and persist sensitive files outside the project without strong boundaries.","dimensions":[{"detail":"Local storage under ~/.openclaw/minivcs is disclosed and there is no remote sync, but backups, diffs, snapshots, and logs are plaintext and may include credential material.","label":"Credentials","name":"environment_proportionality","rating":"concern"},{"detail":"The skill uses a bundled Python script and standard-library dependencies only; the referenced curl|bash text is a prohibition, not an install instruction.","label":"Install Mechanism","name":"install_mechanism","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"The instructions require user confirmation before modify/delete operations, but the implementation accepts arbitrary accessible paths and does not enforce project-root containment.","label":"Instruction Scope","name":"instruction_scope","rating":"concern"},{"detail":"There is no cron, service, shell-profile modification, or privilege escalation, but recovery artifacts persist for 7 or 14 days and can include sensitive files copied from outside the workspace.","label":"Persistence & Privilege","name":"persistence_privilege","rating":"concern"},{"detail":"Versioning, trash, and rollback fit the stated file-protection purpose, but the artifact explicitly includes system paths, credential directories, and .env/config files in its protection scope.","label":"Purpose & Capability","name":"purpose_capability","rating":"concern"}],"guidance":"Install only if you are comfortable with an agent-maintained local backup store that can retain sensitive files. Avoid using it on credential directories, .env files, cloud profiles, SSH/GPG keys, or system paths unless you explicitly intend that, and keep operations limited to trusted project files.","findings":"[AE1] unexpected: Downgraded: the referenced SKILL.md and scripts/minivcs/minivcs.py were present locally and inspected.\n[SC2] unexpected: Overridden: the artifact says not to run curl|bash or dependency installation commands when Python is missing.\n[PE3] expected: Accepted as a Review concern: sensitive credential/config paths are intentionally retained longer and can be copied into the local MiniVCS store.\n[RA2] unexpected: Overridden: the cited text forbids shell config edits; no background service, startup hook, or scheduled persistence was found.\n[SDI-1] unexpected: Accepted: record, delete, and restore flows can operate on absolute paths outside the project root.\n[SDI-2] expected: Accepted as material risk: plaintext retained artifacts may include .ssh, .aws, .kube, Docker, GPG, and .env contents.\n[SQP-2] expected: Partly accepted: destructive restore/remove operations are purpose-aligned but confirmation is instruction-level rather than enforced in the CLI/API.\n[T05] unexpected: Accepted: static evidence matches the script's lack of project-boundary validation for read, move, and overwrite operations.\n[T09] expected: Accepted as a Review concern: plaintext backup storage is disclosed, but restrictive permissions and secret exclusion are not enforced.","agenticRiskFindings":null,"riskSummary":null,"model":null,"checkedAt":1789197943638}}}}}